### Final Results

| Treatment | Test RMSE | Δ vs Baseline |
|-----------|-----------|---------------|
| Baseline (GAT 4-layer/256hid) | 38.51K | — |
| Static RWPE k=16 | 36.29K | **-2.22K** |
