| Rank | Idea | Mem | Collapse Mechanism | Key Risk |
|------|------|-----|--------------------|----------|
| 1 | **PolyWaveNet** | 127 | EMA+Transformer (JEPA-style) | Wavelet implementation complexity |
| 2 | **CE-JEPA** | 126 | EMA+Transformer | Ego-nets too similar on homopolymers |
| 3 | **PolyBG-SSL** | 125 | NT-Xent explicit | Bond graph redundant on tree polymers |
| 4 | **MoMuCon-NT-Xent** | 123 | NT-Xent explicit | Code ready, just needs execution |

**Gap to PerioGT SOTA**: 4.64K (35.44K → 30.80K). The pretraining lever is confirmed as the primary path — but the specific formulation is critical.


