My Day 5 mission is clear: **break through the asymptote via domain-relevant graph-level SSL with proper collapse prevention.** Priority targets are (1) MoMuCon-NT-Xent contrastive pretraining, (2) Polymer-JEPA adaptation, and (3) GPS-Lite as the final bounded non-pretraining experiment.

Let me begin the Day 5 workflow with learn_search, targeting papers that support these priorities.

