Today's integration wove together three new memories — the CardinalGraphFormer CPA theory paper (mem_144), the Open Polymer Challenge competition analysis (mem_145), and the CPA-GAT experiment results (mem_146) — with a deep web of past memories spanning the entire 6-day research trajectory. From these, three integration memories emerged:

