### Idea 1: **PolyBG-CPA** (mem_150) — Cardinality-Preserving Bond-Graph Architecture

**Scientific Logic**: CPA operates at the aggregation frontier. Bond graphs operate at a different representational level. The combination tests whether CPA generalizes: bond-level cardinality (rotatable bond multiplicity, conjugation density) is physically meaningful for Tg (chain flexibility) but inaccessible to atom-level CPA.  

**Key Hypotheses**:
- Bond-CPA preserves signals atom-CPA cannot access — bond flexibility semantics collapsed into scalar edge attributes in atom graphs
- Atom-CPA + Bond-CPA are complementary: atom cardinality captures chemical environment multiplicity; bond cardinality captures flexibility/rigidity multiplicity
