**Architecture**: Parallel atom-CPA-GAT (4 layers, 256-dim) + bond-CPA-GAT (3 layers, 128-dim), NO cross-attention, concatenated readout. 9 ablations including CPA-on/off for each encoder, last-layer-only bond-CPA, and enriched-edge CPA-GAT as a fallback.

