## CPA+PSPE Combined Experiment: NULL RESULT

### Core Finding

**PSPE does NOT complement CPA.** Adding Polymer-Specific Positional Encodings (distance-to-chain-end + monomer-index) to CPA-GAT yields **35.86 ± 1.06 K** — slightly worse than CPA-GAT alone at **35.52 ± 0.41 K**. The complementarity hypothesis is invalidated.

